OAI ZMQ radio (pin 2b69bde6): NEON paths for the cf32<->int16 sample conversion on
aarch64. Without AVX2 the scalar cleanup loop converted every sample (122,880 floats
per 100 MHz slot per antenna) in the UE's rx_poll_thread; that loop was most of the
~470 us per-message ingest that bounded the pipelined lock-step loop at 0.8x (S17).
Apply after oai-zmq-rx-saturate.patch, in the OAI source root: patch -p1 < oai-zmq-neon-convert.patch

